  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Dragon Vein — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level, you have learned to expand your domain. Creatures within your domain cannot teleport or fly more than 10 ft off the ground, otherwise they find themselves getting crushed into the ground and take 5d10 force damage. A creature can take this damage once per turn. Additionally, you are always considered under Ley Line.</p>",
   "chat": ""
